  "info": {
    "title": "Techno",
    "author": "Atomik Rack factory",
    "notes": "A driving techno track in A minor at 132 BPM: a long punchy kick on its own track with clap and hats on another, an acid bass that ducks from the kick, off-beat minor stabs, a modular pulse and a bouncing fifths lead, with a tight chamber and a dotted echo. The intro, the break and the outro are bare: fill them. Open the pulse device and change its sequence, or automate the acid bass cutoff across the second drop."
  },
